      "name": "dsh-realtime-voice",
      "title": {
        "en": "Realtime voice input",
        "zh": "实时语音输入"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Continuous dictation plus cleanup and dictation-translation: speak, and every two neighbouring phrases are polished together before landing in the field — fillers removed, self-corrections followed, Chinese spoken and English written. Exposes a voiceInput service other plugins can attach to.",
        "zh": "连续听写 + 自动排版 + 口述翻译：两句相邻的话一起校对了再插入，去口头语、接住「不对，我是说…」、中文说成英文。并把能力暴露成 voiceInput 服务，别的输入插件可直接接入。"
      },
