    {
      "name": "dsh-archive-rsi",
      "title": {
        "en": "Session archive + PDCA alchemy",
        "zh": "归档会话与 PDCA 炼金"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "CRUD over the Harness session archive plus a PDCA loop that mines historical sessions into measurable findings and adoptable context patches: tool-error rate, correction rate, verification gaps, context pressure and tool-catalog cost, each with session-level evidence and re-measured after adoption. Every session also gets deterministic auto:* tags (error hotspot, verification gap, turn failure, repeat, correction, context pressure, cost outlier, scale, top tools, language). Auto tags are written in Chinese; proposals are deduplicated by content fingerprint and the act step is idempotent; a status strip shows whether a run is in flight, what the last run produced and when the next auto run is due. Tool-layer recursive self-improvement with a sidebar panel.",
        "zh": "会话归档 CRUD + PDCA 数据炼金：从历史会话里算出工具错误率、纠正率、编辑后未验证缺口、上下文压力与工具目录成本，给出带会话级证据的 finding 与可采纳的上下文补丁，采纳后再用后续会话重估；每条会话另有按事实派生的 auto:* 标签（错误热点、验证缺口、回合失败、重复调用、纠正、上下文压力、成本离群、规模、常用工具、语言）。标签用中文；提案按内容指纹去重、行动步骤幂等；面板顶部显示炼金是否在跑、上次结果与下次自动运行时间。带侧边栏面板的工具层递归自我改进。"
      },
      "icon": "plugins/archive-rsi/icon.svg",
