    {
      "name": "dsh-360",
      "title": {
        "en": "dsh-360 — two health checks in one",
        "zh": "dsh-360 两面体检"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "One plugin, two surfaces of health checks, one sidebar panel with two tabs and one shared 18-bucket S~E grade scale (S+/S/S-/A+/A/A-/.../E-). The skills surface grades the on-demand loading path of every skill; the agents surface grades everything that gets injected (instruction files, subagent definitions, agent presets). v0.2 adds a four-axis classification (role / kind / scope / state) plus a skills-only meta-skill layer (meta vs task), a snapshot-first panel that paints the last scan before revalidating, collapsed filters behind one icon, optimization-effect cards with trustworthy undo, and roughly 3x faster scans. Four dsh360_* tools, routes under /api/dsh-360/skills and /api/dsh-360/agents, every write backed up and undoable.",
        "zh": "一个插件、两面体检、一个侧栏面板双 tab、一套共用的 S~E × ± 18 档等级制。技能面评每个技能的按需加载路径；Agents 面评一切会被注入的内容（常驻说明书、子代理定义、agent 预设）。v0.2 增加四轴分类（职责/类型/范围/状态）与技能专属的元技能层级（元技能/任务技能），面板先画上次快照再后台刷新，筛选收进一个图标，优化后有分数/token 效果卡与可靠撤销，扫描速度提升约 3 倍。四个 dsh360_* 工具，路由在 /api/dsh-360/skills 与 /api/dsh-360/agents，所有写入有备份可撤销。"
      },
