    {
      "name": "dsh-task-ledger",
      "title": {
        "en": "Task ledger",
        "zh": "任务账本"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "State that outlives the session: goals, decisions, evidence and next actions live in an external ledger (~/.dsh/task-ledger), not in the transcript. A single-writer resume lease returns a run_id, checkpoint writes are optimistically versioned, and closeout runs an evidence gate before a task may be marked done. Five task_* agent tools plus a sidebar panel that reads the ledger and drives tasks.",
        "zh": "把状态所有权从会话搬到外置任务账本：目标、决策、证据、下一步都在 ~/.dsh/task-ledger 里，不在聊天记录里。续跑时取单写租约拿 run_id，checkpoint 用乐观版本号写入，收尾先跑证据门禁才允许标 done。五个 task_* 工具 + 直接读账本的侧边栏面板。"
      },
