    {
      "name": "dsh-update-check",
      "title": {
        "en": "Version update check",
        "zh": "版本更新检查"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "A sidebar panel that reads the installed Desktop version from the app bundle itself and the newest version from your update source (the same app-update.yml electron-updater uses), then hands an available upgrade to the in-app updater: download, verify, confirm restart. No shell, no replacing a signed .app from the page.",
        "zh": "侧边栏面板：从安装包本体读当前版本、从桌面端自己的更新源（与 electron-updater 同一个 app-update.yml）读最新版本，有新版就交给应用内更新器（下载 → 校验 → 确认重启）。不调 shell，不在页面侧替换签名包。"
      },
