    {
      "name": "dsh-novel-forge",
      "title": {
        "en": "Ink Furnace — novel forge",
        "zh": "墨炉 · 小说炼炉"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "A full novel pipeline behind one premise: premise, world bible, characters, emotional spine, outline, per-chapter beats, prose, continuity review, revision and Markdown/EPUB export. A generic stage engine (src/forge, knows nothing about novels) drives a novel recipe; stages are resumable per item, review findings are salvaged instead of discarded, and a run reports its real model-call/token cost. A female lead is never rewritten as him: gender is canon, pronoun tables are injected into every writing prompt, and a deterministic check flags pronoun drift.",
        "zh": "一句话故事核 → 设定 → 人物 → 情感脊柱 → 大纲 → 细纲 → 正文 → 连续性审校 → 修订 → 导出 Markdown/EPUB 的全流程小说流水线。通用阶段引擎（src/forge 里不出现「小说」字样）驱动小说 recipe：按条目断点续跑，审校结果读不出契约时抢救而不是整段丢弃，运行结束报告真实调用量与 token 消耗；主角性别是硬设定，每章写作/审校/修订 prompt 都带代词对照，另有确定性检查兜住「他/她」漂移。"
      },
